'''Lutrinae Gokurakko''' (聖天ゴクラッコ, ''Shōten Gokurakko'', '''Sacred God Gokurakko''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Otta-smack-u]] introduced in [[The Ururuvu Journals]]. It was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]].

