==Trivia==
*Lutrinae Gokurakko is named similarly to most of the [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoths]], with a taxonomic term followed by a Japanese pun.
**[[wikipedia:Otter|Lutrinae]] is the subfamily of [[wikipedia:Mustelidae|Mustelidae]] that includes all otters.
**Gokurakko is a pun on the Japanese words 極楽 ''gokuraku'' (Heaven, paradise, or the Buddhist concept of a [[wikipedia:Pure land|pure land]]) and 海獺 ''rakko'' (sea otter).
*The word 聖天 ''shōten'' in its Japanese name (聖天ゴクラッコ ''Shōten Gokurakko'') roughly means "sacred god", but is also another name for the Japanese Buddhist god [[wikipedia:Kangiten|Kangiten]].
*The so-called "orb" it carries is actually a dodecahedron.
*It and [[Iguanidae Ibilujon]] are the first enemies with the [[Counter-Surge]] Ability.

